@startuml
title Interaction: AI evaluation collaboration
actor Scheduler
participant API
participant DB
participant EvaluationService
participant "Mistral (LLM)" as Mistral
participant "Serper (Search)" as Serper

Scheduler -> API: trigger background task
API -> EvaluationService: run_ai_evaluation(project_id)
EvaluationService -> DB: fetch Project
EvaluationService -> Mistral: chat(prompt for feedback)
Mistral --> EvaluationService: ai_feedback
EvaluationService -> Mistral: chat(prompt for suggested modules)
Mistral --> EvaluationService: suggested_modules
EvaluationService -> Serper: search_related_work(title, domain)
Serper --> EvaluationService: related_papers, similar_projects
EvaluationService -> DB: upsert Evaluation and update Project status
EvaluationService --> API: completed

@enduml
